472	/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
473	   ELEMENT PILL  (.ds-element-pill)
474	   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
475	   Small white pill that floats anchored to a piece of content
476	   (an equation, a figure) to host action affordances for it. Used
477	   wherever arXiv adds metadata chrome (permalink, copy TeX, alt-text
478	   actions, etc.) that should live on the element rather than in a
479	   margin lane.
480	
481	   The pill is `position: absolute`; the consumer is responsible for
482	   the positioning context (typically `position: relative` on the
483	   element's wrapper) and for the offset (typically `bottom: -14px;
484	   left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);` to straddle the element's
485	   bottom edge by ~50%).
486	
