   ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Light-blue tint floating panel anchored to an inline element on
   click. Same shape and material across:
     - Citation chip popover (reference details + jump-to-reference)
     - Footnote popover (narrow-viewport surfacing of footnote content)
     - Any future "click an inline chip → see more context" pattern

   The popover element itself is `position: fixed` (consumer is
