   `hidden` HTML attribute; visible when the attribute is removed.

   Parts:
     .ds-popover            The panel itself.
     .ds-popover-title      Small uppercase condensed label at the
                            top of the panel (e.g., "Reference 47",
                            "Footnote 3").
     .ds-popover-close      Small × button at top-right.

