   (citation popover, footnote popover).

   Example:
     <span class="ds-popover" role="region" aria-label="Reference 47" hidden>
       <div class="ds-popover-title">Reference 47</div>
       <button class="ds-popover-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
